---
layout: layouts/staff.njk
staffPage: directory
staffTitle: Directory
staffHeading: Network <b>contacts</b>
---
{#- THE MINISTRY'S ADDRESS BOOK (board 11, option A: kept apart from
   Stewardship, with the same rows, search and dialog; Chase kept its own nav
   link). The pastors, technicians and partner churches a ministry works with.

   SHARED BY THE MINISTRY'S TEAM (Chase, 2026-09-26): a new team member
   inherits the ministry's contacts, and anybody on the team may correct one.
   Each card says who added it. Supporters are not here: they stay in
   Stewardship, the owner's alone. -#}
<div class="sw-top">
  <input type="search" id="dirFind" class="sw-find" maxlength="80"
         data-i18n-attr="placeholder:dir.search,aria-label:dir.search"
         placeholder="Search contacts" aria-label="Search contacts">
  <button class="ghost-btn" id="addContactBtn" type="button" data-i18n="dir.add">+ Add contact</button>
</div>

<div class="tw sw-cards">
  <table>
    <thead><tr>
      <th data-i18n="dir.name">Name</th><th data-i18n="dir.role">Role</th>
      <th data-i18n="dir.email">Email</th><th data-i18n="dir.phone">Phone</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody id="contacts">
      <tr class="empty-row"><td colspan="4"><p class="empty" data-i18n="common.loading">Loading&hellip;</p></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<p class="hint" id="saveStatus"></p>

{#- One card, opened over the list: the same .dlg as Resources and
   Stewardship. Adding and correcting are the same form. -#}
<div class="dlg-back" id="contactBack" hidden>
  <form class="form dlg" id="contactForm">
    <h3 id="contactFormTitle" data-i18n="dir.new">New contact</h3>
    <p class="sw-sub" id="contactAdded" hidden></p>
    <input type="hidden" id="contactIndex" value="">
    <input type="text" id="contactName" placeholder="Name" data-i18n-attr="placeholder:dir.name,aria-label:dir.name" aria-label="Name" required>
    <input type="text" id="contactRole" placeholder="Role" data-i18n-attr="placeholder:dir.role,aria-label:dir.role" aria-label="Role">
    <div class="fgroup">
      <span class="flabel" data-i18n="dir.emails">Emails</span>
      <div id="contactEmails"></div>
      <button class="ghost-btn" type="button" id="addEmailRow" data-i18n="dir.addEmail">+ Add email</button>
    </div>
    <div class="fgroup">
      <span class="flabel" data-i18n="dir.phones">Phone numbers</span>
      <div id="contactPhones"></div>
      <button class="ghost-btn" type="button" id="addPhoneRow" data-i18n="dir.addPhone">+ Add phone</button>
    </div>
    <div class="frow">
      <button class="solid-btn" type="submit" data-i18n="dir.save">Save contact</button>
      <button class="ghost-btn" type="button" id="contactCancel" data-i18n="common.cancel">Cancel</button>
      <button class="ghost-btn del" type="button" id="contactDelete" data-i18n="dir.delete" hidden>Remove</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</div>
